# ── Icons — keep sized variants, ignore the raw source ───────────────────────
# AppIcon.png is the original 1024px source; AppIcon-1024.png is the copy used by Xcode
Scout/Resources/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/AppIcon.png

